# Phase 0 needs no secrets — stub /v1/chat works without Azure.

# Phase 1 — Azure OpenAI (copy to .env and fill in):
# AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=https://YOUR_RESOURCE.openai.azure.com/
# AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY=your-key-here
# AZURE_OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT=your-chat-deployment-name
# AZURE_OPENAI_API_VERSION=2024-12-01-preview

# Phase 6 (AKS) prefers Workload Identity — avoid relying on long-lived keys in cluster Secrets.
